          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जमा करणे — jamā karṇe — \"to deposit; to collect\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मी पगाराचे पैसे खात्यात जमा केले. mī pagārāce paise khātyāt jamā kele. I paid my salary into my account."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने जमा केलं, tyāne jamā kelaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The verb agrees with the money: पैसे जमा केले, रक्कम (rakkam) जमा केली."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जमा करणे (jamā karṇe) joins जमा, \"collected, deposited\", a loan through Persian, usually traced to Arabic jamʿ, \"gathering\", to the light verb करणे."
            }
          ]
        },
